### 1. `style.css`
This file contains your base styling along with the two media queries for responsive screen sizes:
* Base rules defining full width on mobile viewports.
* Query `#1` (`@media screen and (min-width: 772px)`) setting container width to `45vw` and limiting image heights to `30vh`.
* Query `#2` (`@media screen and (min-width: 998px)`) setting container width to `30vw` for desktop viewports.

### 2. `index.html`
This file contains the HTML markup linking to `style.css` in the `<head>` tag and structuring your content blocks (`<header>`, `<main>`, and content `<div>` elements wrapped around your images).

